{"game": "back-4-blood", "language": "schinese", "appid": 924970, "month": "2023-11", "window": 4, "start_date": 1700784000, "end_date": 1701388799, "month_true_total": 264, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:06:36 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "152591827", "author": {"steamid": "76561198379344102", "personaname": "刘天真", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198379344102/", "num_games_owned": 41, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 1002, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 338, "last_played": 1704286722, "avatar": "3f5e9daea59216d7fe13df4e031d3537580e5e21"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "488的你是依托答辩，80的你yyds  买性比", "timestamp_created": 1701363677, "timestamp_updated": 1701363677, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "152589862", "author": {"steamid": "76561199119965481", "personaname": "行玲", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199119965481/", "num_games_owned": 111, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 1256, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 439, "last_played": 1719580278, "avatar": "127b7964d077f5f51fd525c9d03ad4df2582cfe8"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "快把全屏搞上好吗，你看现在哪个游戏还没有全屏的", "timestamp_created": 1701361623, "timestamp_updated": 1701361623, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "152587493", "author": {"steamid": "76561198267855781", "personaname": "榨油南瓜瓜", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/174947714/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 361, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 45, "last_played": 1701878077, "avatar": "6889e542266ff1eca9c32d7f405a723a0e19f756"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "不好评好不好玩，因为没人陪我玩哈哈哈哈\n只能说和AI队友的关系挺好的嗯嗯\n还是玩求生之路吧（", "timestamp_created": 1701359087, "timestamp_updated": 1701359087, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "152587063", "author": {"steamid": "76561198294102427", "personaname": "De_Shigure", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198294102427/", "num_games_owned": 220, "num_reviews": 35, "playtime_forever": 1077, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 677, "last_played": 1701957992, "avatar": "46cc84fd15eaac31f097c36eaa503e6a0b8e0840"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "老兵难度\n玩家：还是太简单了\n噩梦难度\n制作组：还是太简单了\n", "timestamp_created": 1701358627, "timestamp_updated": 1701358627, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.511111080646514893", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "152582625", "author": {"steamid": "76561198829625055", "personaname": "我是你黄老师", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198829625055/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 668, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 335, "last_played": 1749729938, "avatar": "af1cf9cf15be50bc6eda5a5c35bb1698bbf77ecd"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "PS5上2000多个小时喋血的老玩家，我可以告诉大家一个客观事实为什么耐玩。\n\n你们要站在一个【角色扮演&肉鸽类游戏】的视角看喋血，比如哈迪斯，死亡细胞那种，那这游戏依旧是打僵尸的神作，别跟我替什么僵尸世界大战，拉跨，即便是高难度刷两把无感，就觉得无聊，喋血的尸潮会让你有压迫感，操作感的。\n\n大家猛吹求生2，是在吹PVP啊，是啊，2万多人在线PVP人数站90%以上，如果打僵尸通关，那不好意思，我站喋血复仇，你们喜欢PVP被挂虐我是没有意见的。\n\n求生2是射击游戏，喋血是枪械射击游戏，本质有区别的，求生2的武器就算打MOD，同质化也很严重，M16和AK我真没感觉有什么区别，喋血的武器让你真的能感受不一样的枪械，且丰富，还有配件，且带有肉鸽RPG元素，卡牌定制，光一个治疗位，你就可以自定义出治疗狙击，治疗近战，治疗冲锋手，治疗霰弹近战手，太丰富了，就看你怎么去脑补，各种搭配，这才是角色扮演该有的样子吧？所以我站喋血。\n\n卡牌不要钱！卡牌不要钱!卡牌不要钱！重要事情说三遍，不需要氪金，等级解锁。\n\n又有人说，啊，那打僵尸也是求生系列牛啊，牛的是什么？剧情啊！剧情喋血差了一些，没什么记忆了！但是打僵尸的话，我还是只站喋血复仇。\n\n求生之路2打僵尸的部分 所有难度我只玩了一遍，因为第二遍我大概知道僵尸什么时候出现，尸潮什么时候出现，地图丰富？地图确实丰富，通关了就无聊了，请问是在多个地图里最多玩3遍耐玩？还是虽然地图不多（其实也不少），但是随机性自定义丰富足够多耐玩？\n\n人云亦云真的是特别不好的！喋血打击感，随机性，难度，爽快感，压迫感，是我玩2000个小时的原因。", "timestamp_created": 1701354562, "timestamp_updated": 1701354562, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.466931194067001343", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}]}